stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> ACCEPTED_PENDING_DISPATCH: job + outbox committed
  ACCEPTED_PENDING_DISPATCH --> READY: durable dispatch acceptance
  READY --> RUNNING: worker owns job and host
  RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED: required outcome verified
  RUNNING --> FAILED: known resolved failure
  RUNNING --> NEEDS_RECONCILIATION: uncertain remote outcome
  NEEDS_RECONCILIATION --> SUCCEEDED: original evidence proves success
  NEEDS_RECONCILIATION --> FAILED: original outcome resolved
  SUCCEEDED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
